In regards to the gray dragon scale:

Try wishing for blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail, this way your armor is 
blessed as well as + :)

In regards to wishing for other things, I recently (January or February) read
about 10 sheets of paper entitled Nethack Spoilers.  In that marvelous tome
there were many suggestions as to useful things to wish for (almost all of
which I concur whole heartedly.

Some of these are:

blessed +3 war hammer named Mjollnir
blessed +3 broad sword named Stormbringer
blessed +3 long sword named Excaliber (or is it Excalibre? :( )

blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail
blessed +3 shield of reflection
blessed +3 boots of speed (or jumping if you are already speeded)
blessed +3 cloak of protection
blessed +3 helm of telepathy (or is it helmet?)
blessed +3 Hawaiian Shirt
blessed +3 gauntlets of power

blessed wand of polymorph (so you can turn all of your useless junk to goodies)

finally, 3 blessed spellbooks of polymorph, identify, death, etc.
3 blessed scrolls of identify, enchant armor/weapon, and charging (blessed
  scrolls of charging can charge a wand of wishing or a blessed magic lamp once
  each.
3 blessed potions of gain ability, gain level, holy water, invisibility, or
  see invisible

and

3 cursed scrolls of genocide (this attracts the monsters so for instance if
  you are high enough level, genocide wraiths and eat their corpses...)

Useful tools:
blessed tinning kit
blessed pick axe
blessed tin opener
blessed blindfold
blessed bag of holding

I almost forgot and this is very important!
blessed amulet of lifesaving

